Sound effects in this folder are by Kenney (https://kenney.nl), released under
CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain): https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

Downloaded from the Kenney mirror at https://github.com/Cy4nWare/sfx-api
(kenney.nl itself was not reachable from the build machine), then converted
from Ogg Vorbis to mono 64 kbps MP3 with ffmpeg so that Safari/iOS can play them.

